A fiber that only reads a cell is still pending where the frame that spawned it returns: what it reads there (the answered handle, an answered loan, a loan stored in the caller's cell, a handle in a record, the list the cell was made with, its second cell) escapes, and the caller writes a copy of it, accepted (ownership-v3-kernel.md §13 item 12, amended 2026-11-22, #2604). Its live twin is CellReaderHeldLive.
